# The playground: a disc of radius 3, all ground. Digits mark where players 1 to 4 start, and m
# where a wild monster stands (a ball for now, #19), with room to walk a ring around it.
# Format: see Region.parse (sim/region.gd).
origin 6 3
   . . . .
  . . . . .
 . . . 1 . .
. m 3 . 4 . .
 . . 2 . . .
  . . . . .
   . . . .
